A caption's placeholder is any `#` that does not begin a tag

```
![p](p.png)
^ Figure #* q
.
<figure>
  <img src="p.png" alt="p">
  <figcaption>Figure 1* q</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![p](p.png)
^ Figure #, q
.
<figure>
  <img src="p.png" alt="p">
  <figcaption>Figure 1, q</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![p](p.png)
^ Figure ## q
.
<figure>
  <img src="p.png" alt="p">
  <figcaption>Figure 1# q</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![p](p.png)
^ Figure #é q
.
<figure>
  <img src="p.png" alt="p">
  <figcaption>Figure 1é q</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![p](p.png)
^ Figure #1 q
.
<figure>
  <img src="p.png" alt="p">
  <figcaption>Figure <span class="tag"><strong>#1</strong></span> q</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![p](p.png)
^ Figure #-a q
.
<figure>
  <img src="p.png" alt="p">
  <figcaption>Figure <span class="tag"><strong>#-a</strong></span> q</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![p](p.png)
^ Figure x #* y #: z
.
<figure>
  <img src="p.png" alt="p">
  <figcaption>Figure x 1* y #: z</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![p](p.png)
^ Figure#* q
.
<figure>
  <img src="p.png" alt="p">
  <figcaption>Figure1* q</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![p](p.png)
^ Figure x#tag q
.
<figure>
  <img src="p.png" alt="p">
  <figcaption>Figure x#tag q</figcaption>
</figure>
```
